                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I love this game to death! I remember playing it when it first came out and I found it so hard! It's not too bad, but takes some time to get used to! In the beginning I had a HUGE crashing problem for my first three hours! I wanted to quit but I was having too much fun! All I did to fix it was verify the integrity of the files. It's a very zany story, with lots of fun levels, and tons of characters to unlock and level up! I highly recommend it!!",
